- id: R1
  status: done
  title: "REST Blog API (stdlib, single file)"
  quote: "Build a REST Blog API in Python using only the standard library (http.server + sqlite3). CRUD for posts, X-API-Key auth, JSON bodies, localhost:8080, single file blog_api.py."
  steps:
    - {do: "Spec written and lint passes", check: "cmd: PYTHONPATH=.forgemyspec/harness python3 -m forgemyspec lint forgemyspec-bundle/blog-api/spec.yaml --formal"}
    - {do: "User approved the spec", check: "cmd: PYTHONPATH=.forgemyspec/harness python3 -m forgemyspec lock --check forgemyspec-bundle/blog-api"}
    - {do: "blog_api.py implemented, boundary tests pass", check: "cmd: python3 -m unittest discover -s forgemyspec-bundle/blog-api/../../tests -t ."}
    - {do: "Gate passes", check: "cmd: PYTHONPATH=.forgemyspec/harness python3 -m forgemyspec gate forgemyspec-bundle/blog-api"}
  evidence: "gate: RESULT: PASS, 8 boundary tests"
